opex.text:
Same‑hospital other operating expenses increased by $210 million, or 6.4%, in the year ended December 31, 2024 compared to 2023. The changes in other operating expenses during the year ended December 31, 2024 included:

• an $86 million increase in medical fees;

• repair and maintenance costs that were $21 million higher;

• gains recognized during the 2023 period that were $19 million higher than in the 2024 period;

